==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/481#issuecomment-247317207"},"message":"For now I manually had to do to repositories on smaug to be published\n\n```\ngit config --add remote.datalad-public.push 'refs/tags/*'; git config --add remote.datalad-public.push 'refs/heads/*'\n```\n\nso I would say that `create_pub...` should do that by default, and either allow to tune the list of those refs to be pushed, or just have an option such as `--do-not-add-push-refs` which would instruct to not do it.\nIt must be careful though in `--existing=reconfigure` mode to not change those settings if already defined... or may be would be safer to not change those at all in `reconfigure` mode -- I will just fix up manually those lacking them for now","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1475868041,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI1MjMzODgxMg==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/481#issuecomment-252338812"},"message":"Anybody is working on this one @mih or @bpoldrack ?","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1477018249,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDgzMTUwMjYwMQ=="},"added":["WIP"],"removed":[]},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1486116111,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3NzIwOTExMQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/481#issuecomment-277209111"},"message":"Looking into this now. I agree that this needs to be configurable. I agree that this needs to be done in a git-native way.\n\nLooking at `publish` it seems a precondition for this is to stop calling 'push' with specific refspecs.\n\nWhen we are doing that, we could consider offloading more duties to git annex by making more use of `sync`. this could take care of all kinds of conflicts, and data transfer in one go. We still would want to perform uni-directional updates, but `--no-pull` should do that. All that for annex repos only, of course.\n\nAfter annex-sync is done (or for any other non-annex repo), we can run a simple `git push \u003cremote\u003e` to push the remaining configured \nitems to send.\n\nAny comments @bpoldrack","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1486127662,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3NzI0Mzg4NQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/481#issuecomment-277243885"},"message":"Not ATM. I agree.","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1486731827,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDE0OlVubGFiZWxlZEV2ZW50OTU3MjM4Mjcx"},"added":[],"removed":["WIP"]},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1486731865,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3ODkzNzM1Ng==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/481#issuecomment-278937356"},"message":"#1275 is where we are in the discussion right now.","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1486731866,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50OTU3MjM5MDA0"},"status":2}]}